WEBVTT

00:31.662 --> 00:35.212
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.232 --> 00:38.612
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.882 --> 00:44.852
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:46.012 --> 00:49.642
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.662 --> 00:53.172
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.192 --> 00:56.682
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.702 --> 01:00.212
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.232 --> 01:06.292
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.552 --> 01:23.832
Si Jin

01:23.852 --> 01:28.012
Episode 15

01:28.032 --> 01:29.982
(Earl Dongping's Mansion, Jiang)
I'm so glad

01:30.002 --> 01:31.842
that my grandson

01:32.082 --> 01:34.482
has returned alive.

01:34.652 --> 01:37.582
Only then

01:37.602 --> 01:39.162
can our entire family

01:39.162 --> 01:40.732
sit together.

01:43.332 --> 01:46.912
Our ancestors are protecting us.

01:46.932 --> 01:47.732
Grandmother, sorry

01:47.732 --> 01:49.782
for being unfilial
and having you worried.

01:49.802 --> 01:51.472
It's not just your grandmother.

01:51.492 --> 01:52.802
The whole mansion is

01:52.802 --> 01:54.832
anxious for you.

01:54.852 --> 01:56.332
Si even offended the Grand Princess

01:56.332 --> 01:58.562
because of you.

01:59.562 --> 02:01.752
She's offended the Grand Princess.

02:01.772 --> 02:04.652
Who knows
what the consequences will be?

02:07.012 --> 02:08.882
But when you think about it,

02:09.172 --> 02:11.932
it was fortunate

02:11.962 --> 02:14.612
that Si refused to admit guilt.

02:15.082 --> 02:16.312
Yes, yes.

02:16.332 --> 02:18.492
That's lesser harm done.

02:19.082 --> 02:20.332
Zhan coming back

02:20.332 --> 02:21.522
is the greatest fortune

02:21.522 --> 02:23.152
for our family.

02:23.172 --> 02:24.872
If Zhan is safe,

02:24.892 --> 02:27.882
a bit of risk won't matter.

02:28.052 --> 02:31.282
The reason my grandson is alive today

02:31.362 --> 02:34.162
is thanks to Commandant Yu and Miss Lu.

02:34.362 --> 02:37.162
On behalf of the entire family,

02:37.212 --> 02:41.162
thank you, Commandant Yu, Miss Lu.

02:46.012 --> 02:48.332
Commandant Yu, Miss Lu,

02:48.522 --> 02:50.332
we've faced danger together.

02:50.652 --> 02:52.152
If you need anything,

02:52.172 --> 02:53.532
I will not

02:54.452 --> 02:57.682
hesitate to risk my life for you.

03:02.052 --> 03:05.342
I heard that Miss Lu took care of my son

03:05.362 --> 03:08.222
day and night in the wilderness.

03:08.242 --> 03:11.932
If it harms her reputation,

03:12.082 --> 03:14.452
you must take responsibility. Got it?

03:14.452 --> 03:15.812
Sit down.

03:16.612 --> 03:19.772
Father, how can we repay kindness
with enmity?

03:19.842 --> 03:22.092
Please let Miss Chuchu go.

03:23.522 --> 03:24.632
Zhan,

03:24.652 --> 03:26.842
don't cause trouble again.

03:27.012 --> 03:28.262
Look.

03:28.282 --> 03:30.712
Your father is getting older.

03:30.732 --> 03:33.712
His hair has turned
much grayer these days.

03:33.732 --> 03:35.282
Alright, Anmou.

03:35.332 --> 03:37.172
He's just returned.

03:37.172 --> 03:38.872
Stop lecturing him.

03:38.892 --> 03:40.252
Zhan,

03:40.932 --> 03:41.842
from now on,

03:41.842 --> 03:44.222
you can do whatever you want,

03:44.242 --> 03:46.332
as long as you're happy.

03:54.562 --> 03:55.922
Grandmother,

03:57.012 --> 03:58.372
Father,

03:59.522 --> 04:02.372
I've been wrong all along,

04:02.652 --> 04:04.612
making you worry about me.

04:04.772 --> 04:07.322
After this, I finally understood

04:08.042 --> 04:09.752
why Si wanted me
to practice martial arts

04:09.772 --> 04:11.442
and improve my skills.

04:13.252 --> 04:15.022
If I could be

04:15.042 --> 04:16.262
as skilled as Yu,

04:16.282 --> 04:18.882
or have an official position
like Mr. Zhen,

04:19.132 --> 04:21.052
they'd no longer dare to bully me.

04:21.372 --> 04:23.122
They bully me because I'm weak.

04:23.722 --> 04:26.932
From now on, I will become stronger.

04:27.572 --> 04:28.962
They bully me because our family

04:28.962 --> 04:30.432
is powerless and declining,

04:30.452 --> 04:31.942
so I will try my best

04:31.962 --> 04:33.662
to bring honor to our family.

04:33.692 --> 04:35.202
In short,

04:35.332 --> 04:37.252
I will no longer slack off.

04:37.572 --> 04:40.562
Please rest assured,
Grandmother and elders.

04:42.922 --> 04:44.492
Good.

04:44.772 --> 04:47.902
It's rare that my grandson
has this awakening.

04:47.922 --> 04:51.292
Our family has hope now.

04:51.372 --> 04:53.132
Jiang, if you don't mind,

04:53.152 --> 04:54.572
I'll practice martial arts with you.

04:54.572 --> 04:55.482
That's great.

04:55.482 --> 04:56.932
Count me in.

05:01.652 --> 05:02.502
Alright.

05:02.522 --> 05:04.022
He's just back.

05:04.042 --> 05:05.572
There's no rush for things

05:05.572 --> 05:07.112
like striving for better.

05:07.132 --> 05:08.492
Ancheng,

05:08.692 --> 05:10.872
I cannot agree

05:10.892 --> 05:12.942
with what you just said.

05:12.962 --> 05:14.552
Studies

05:14.572 --> 05:17.352
are about persistence day by day.

05:17.372 --> 05:18.972
It accumulates over time.

05:19.372 --> 05:21.262
If Zhan wants to improve,

05:21.282 --> 05:23.502
I'll give you the books
your brother studied

05:23.522 --> 05:27.082
when he was preparing for the exams.

05:27.082 --> 05:27.992
Uncle Anmou,

05:28.012 --> 05:30.092
I don't plan to take the imperial exams.

05:33.112 --> 05:35.242
I want to be an Imperial Insignia Guard.

05:41.792 --> 05:44.312
(Morning Drizzle, Haitang Chamber)

05:44.372 --> 05:45.582
This is a small gift

05:45.602 --> 05:47.292
for you.

05:51.602 --> 05:53.632
It's cold and clear, not too sweet.

05:53.652 --> 05:54.582
I like it.

05:54.602 --> 05:55.772
Based on your character,

05:55.772 --> 05:57.612
I specially made it for you.

05:57.692 --> 05:59.052
Thank you.

06:01.652 --> 06:03.012
Chuchu,

06:03.082 --> 06:05.632
thank you for saving my brother.

06:05.652 --> 06:07.202
No need for this.

06:07.602 --> 06:08.822
It seems you still don't know.

06:08.842 --> 06:10.582
These were all arranged by Qi.

06:10.602 --> 06:13.442
Didn't he tell you?

06:14.282 --> 06:15.682
No.

06:15.722 --> 06:17.732
Since your brother went missing,

06:17.842 --> 06:20.052
Qi hadn't slept for several nights.

06:20.072 --> 06:21.812
He led his men to search
through the night

06:21.812 --> 06:23.282
and reviewed the river defense map.

06:23.302 --> 06:24.282
When he finally deduced

06:24.282 --> 06:26.382
Jiang Zhan's location,
he sent me to find him,

06:26.402 --> 06:27.992
so I did.

06:28.012 --> 06:29.442
In that case,

06:29.652 --> 06:31.232
you all knew

06:31.252 --> 06:33.052
my brother was still alive?

06:34.692 --> 06:36.172
Sorry, Jiang Si.

06:36.482 --> 06:38.942
Qi told me repeatedly

06:38.962 --> 06:40.502
that I must not bring him back.

06:40.522 --> 06:42.812
If the Grand Princess had found out,

06:42.812 --> 06:44.202
he'd be dead for sure.

06:44.252 --> 06:46.052
To ensure nothing went wrong,

06:46.372 --> 06:48.082
we didn't even tell you.

06:50.962 --> 06:52.492
I understand now.

06:53.252 --> 06:54.612
Thank you.

06:58.892 --> 07:00.812
(Guangju Restaurant)
After this calamity,

07:00.812 --> 07:03.132
Jiang Zhan changed completely.

07:03.132 --> 07:06.022
He has been waking up early
and working late.

07:06.042 --> 07:07.522
A fallen playboy like him

07:07.522 --> 07:09.482
did endure hard work,

07:09.482 --> 07:10.922
passed the selection,

07:10.922 --> 07:12.972
and became an Imperial Insignia Guard.

08:14.762 --> 08:15.602
You hit it!

08:15.602 --> 08:17.562
Young Master, you hit it!

08:17.692 --> 08:19.292
You're truly amazing.

09:01.322 --> 09:03.592
The Cui, Yang, and Zhang families

09:03.612 --> 09:04.992
lost their beloved kids.

09:05.012 --> 09:07.372
Duke An's heir accused
Princess Mingyue in court,

09:07.372 --> 09:10.042
but she feigned illness to avoid him.

09:10.042 --> 09:11.472
How..

09:11.492 --> 09:13.092
- Great.
- Thanks.

09:14.682 --> 09:17.452
Will this case end?

09:18.612 --> 09:20.662
Don't keep us in suspense.

09:20.682 --> 09:22.202
Yes. Just tell us.

09:22.202 --> 09:25.182
Please be patient and listen to me.

09:25.202 --> 09:27.232
This case shocked Chang'an.

09:27.252 --> 09:29.772
The commoners were talking about it,

09:29.772 --> 09:31.892
and it even reached the Palace.

09:31.892 --> 09:34.492
Upon hearing this,
His Majesty issued an imperial edict

09:34.492 --> 09:35.852
to punish evil

09:36.372 --> 09:37.832
and promote good.

09:37.852 --> 09:40.632
Cui Mingyue, Grand Princess's daughter,

09:40.652 --> 09:43.472
has no morals or manners.

09:43.492 --> 09:45.042
Given that she's still young

09:45.042 --> 09:46.712
and that she was influenced,

09:46.732 --> 09:48.542
she shall be punished as a warning.

09:48.562 --> 09:50.592
She'll be demoted to a County Princess

09:50.612 --> 09:53.502
and relocated to Lingshui
to reflect on her wrongs.

09:53.522 --> 09:56.902
Ji Chongyi, son of Duke An,

09:56.922 --> 10:00.072
is immoral and unruly.

10:00.092 --> 10:01.712
He seduced Princess Mingyue,

10:01.732 --> 10:04.612
indulged in his desires,
and caused a tragedy.

10:04.612 --> 10:08.112
He shall be forbidden
from being an official.

10:08.132 --> 10:10.282
Duke An didn't teach his son well.

10:10.292 --> 10:12.132
His salary shall be deducted
for three years.

10:12.132 --> 10:14.572
(Graceful and Poised)
Hopefully, he shall follow the rules,

10:14.582 --> 10:16.072
speak cautiously, and act prudently.

10:16.092 --> 10:18.282
The authorities shall carry it out.

10:18.302 --> 10:21.182
(Learned and Sophisticated)
The authorities shall carry it out.

10:21.202 --> 10:23.162
Accept the edict.

10:43.322 --> 10:45.612
His Majesty has ordered:

10:50.202 --> 10:52.092
Jiang Zhan from Earl Dongping's Mansion

10:52.092 --> 10:54.712
is a quick-witted and studious fighter.

10:54.732 --> 10:57.072
(Jiang Zhan)
He shall be an Imperial Insignia Guard.

10:57.092 --> 10:59.422
Earl Dongping taught his son well.

10:59.442 --> 11:02.112
His title can be inherited
for five generations.

11:02.132 --> 11:04.332
The authorities shall carry it out.

11:06.472 --> 11:09.312
(Virtues Run Far)

11:09.322 --> 11:11.232
Earl Dongping, Mr. Zhan,

11:11.252 --> 11:13.282
accept the edict and thank His Majesty.

11:13.652 --> 11:16.692
Thank His Majesty for the great favor.

11:19.772 --> 11:21.132
Rise.

11:25.372 --> 11:26.422
Sure.

11:26.442 --> 11:28.252
Thank you.

11:29.972 --> 11:32.162
I've worked so hard for all this time,

11:32.652 --> 11:34.612
but with just an imperial edict,

11:35.202 --> 11:36.132
I wouldn't even have

11:36.132 --> 11:37.692
to attend the selection.

11:38.522 --> 11:40.332
This is a good thing.

11:42.922 --> 11:44.882
Zhan, you're so lucky.

11:45.162 --> 11:46.502
Zhan,

11:46.522 --> 11:49.662
this is such a great thing.

11:49.682 --> 11:52.252
You've benefited from misfortune.

11:52.732 --> 11:54.852
The Emperor has truly favored

11:54.852 --> 11:56.522
our family.

11:56.522 --> 11:57.882
Favored our family?

11:58.092 --> 12:00.352
His Majesty is favoring
the Grand Princess.

12:00.372 --> 12:02.282
He's promoting my brother

12:02.282 --> 12:03.652
to stop us from pursuing it further

12:03.652 --> 12:05.752
so Cui Mingyue wouldn't get hurt.

12:05.772 --> 12:06.972
Don't say that.

12:06.972 --> 12:09.112
If someone hears you,

12:09.132 --> 12:11.832
the consequences would be unimaginable.

12:11.852 --> 12:13.612
This child...

12:14.612 --> 12:15.972
Zhan,

12:16.522 --> 12:19.092
I thought that our title

12:19.092 --> 12:20.562
would end

12:20.562 --> 12:22.112
with your father's generation.

12:22.132 --> 12:25.732
But you earned two more generations.

12:26.252 --> 12:28.592
You've made a great contribution

12:28.612 --> 12:30.382
to our family.

12:30.402 --> 12:31.762
Grandmother,

12:31.892 --> 12:33.402
do you think

12:34.492 --> 12:37.002
the beating I took was worth it?

13:11.282 --> 13:12.972
Why are you here alone?

13:14.442 --> 13:15.802
I...

13:18.492 --> 13:20.092
Your family is looking for you.

13:20.092 --> 13:21.452
They're worried.

13:23.372 --> 13:24.762
I just thought...

13:25.132 --> 13:26.882
How did you know I was here?

13:28.612 --> 13:30.042
I took a chance.

13:30.522 --> 13:32.692
We first met here, didn't we?

13:32.732 --> 13:34.402
The weather was nice,

13:34.492 --> 13:35.922
so I thought you might come here

13:35.922 --> 13:37.452
to enjoy the scenery.

13:40.972 --> 13:42.972
I just wanted to be alone for a while.

13:44.652 --> 13:46.452
Then pretend I'm not here.

13:48.972 --> 13:51.572
No, I mean I want to be alone...

13:53.012 --> 13:54.372
Annoying.

14:07.492 --> 14:09.212
I just didn't expect

14:10.042 --> 14:12.122
that His Majesty would use our title

14:12.402 --> 14:14.372
to silence us.

14:15.772 --> 14:17.642
What's even more ridiculous

14:18.562 --> 14:20.252
is that the most useful thing

14:21.162 --> 14:23.522
I've done for my family

14:25.092 --> 14:26.882
was to get beaten up.

14:35.012 --> 14:37.692
Do you think I'm useless?

14:41.322 --> 14:42.802
You know.

14:44.492 --> 14:45.542
Since I was a child,

14:45.562 --> 14:47.162
I loved reading storybooks.

14:48.772 --> 14:51.332
I wanted to be a wandering heroine.

14:51.522 --> 14:53.762
But I never stepped out of the house

14:54.802 --> 14:56.402
but only dreamed

14:56.732 --> 14:58.692
of the vast rivers and mountains.

15:02.092 --> 15:03.452
But look.

15:03.652 --> 15:06.612
I'm sitting here today.

15:09.132 --> 15:10.492
So,

15:10.652 --> 15:12.572
no matter how far away a place is,

15:13.562 --> 15:15.452
if we keep it in our hearts,

15:16.402 --> 15:18.002
we will always reach it.

15:25.852 --> 15:27.972
We will always reach it...

15:32.802 --> 15:34.572
We will always reach it.

15:34.732 --> 15:37.572
I've said it. I won't go to Lingshui.

15:40.442 --> 15:41.542
Mother,

15:41.562 --> 15:43.402
I don't want to go to Lingshui.

15:45.092 --> 15:46.972
Regardless, you have to go.

15:47.132 --> 15:48.902
Are you going to defy the edict?

15:49.652 --> 15:51.972
Mother, please ask Uncle to show mercy.

15:51.972 --> 15:54.022
He will listen to whatever you say.

15:54.042 --> 15:55.882
Why don't you understand?

15:56.012 --> 15:58.882
I'm sending you to avoid the storm.

15:59.132 --> 16:00.782
Right now, in the court,

16:00.802 --> 16:02.492
the officials are accusing you,

16:02.492 --> 16:04.592
and commoners are gossiping about you.

16:04.612 --> 16:06.452
Rumors can ruin you.

16:06.562 --> 16:08.352
I went through a lot of trouble

16:08.562 --> 16:10.372
to get this imperial edict

16:10.372 --> 16:11.832
for you.

16:11.852 --> 16:13.522
Your Grace,

16:14.132 --> 16:16.732
Her Highness is doing this for you.

16:16.732 --> 16:19.262
Please go to Lingshui
and avoid the trouble.

16:19.282 --> 16:20.682
Once it passes,

16:20.682 --> 16:22.632
Her Highness will ask His Majesty

16:22.652 --> 16:24.452
to bring you back.

16:24.772 --> 16:27.182
You're her only daughter.

16:27.202 --> 16:28.202
How could she bear

16:28.202 --> 16:30.402
to be separated from you?

16:33.682 --> 16:35.042
Well...

16:36.042 --> 16:37.852
How long do I have to stay there?

16:39.972 --> 16:41.542
Stay there until you truly repent

16:41.562 --> 16:43.402
and stop causing trouble.

16:44.562 --> 16:45.502
Mother,

16:45.522 --> 16:47.232
I already know my mistake.

16:47.252 --> 16:48.232
Please rest assured.

16:48.252 --> 16:50.222
I will go to Lingshui.

16:50.242 --> 16:51.772
I'll go to the ancestral hall every day

16:51.772 --> 16:53.512
to recite scriptures for my cousin.

16:53.532 --> 16:55.362
I'll never cause trouble again.

17:03.852 --> 17:05.222
It's getting cold.

17:05.242 --> 17:06.682
Bring some thick clothes for her.

17:06.682 --> 17:09.842
She has a weak stomach
and is a picky eater.

17:10.002 --> 17:12.562
Send two of our chefs to go with her.

17:12.612 --> 17:14.872
Your Highness, rest assured.

17:14.892 --> 17:16.972
I'll prepare everything for her.

17:18.292 --> 17:20.312
Reflect on yourself properly.

17:20.332 --> 17:22.042
Don't disappoint me again.

17:22.722 --> 17:24.172
Understood, Mother.

17:34.132 --> 17:35.492
Lyu.

17:37.292 --> 17:40.132
What have I done wrong?

17:41.292 --> 17:43.892
It's a pity I wasn't cruel enough.

17:45.852 --> 17:48.282
I should've stuck

17:48.722 --> 17:51.362
a dozen or twenty holes into Jiang Zhan

17:52.242 --> 17:54.212
so he'd die thoroughly.

18:20.052 --> 18:21.412
Wait.

18:23.482 --> 18:25.082
You just saved me.

18:25.162 --> 18:26.522
Tell me.

18:26.852 --> 18:28.322
What do you want?

18:32.922 --> 18:34.282
Go.

18:34.722 --> 18:36.692
Send a message to Zaoshu Lane,

18:37.242 --> 18:38.242
and tell Yu Qi to come

18:38.242 --> 18:40.142
to Wuli Pavilion tomorrow

18:40.162 --> 18:41.592
to see me off.

18:41.612 --> 18:43.002
Tell him

18:43.532 --> 18:45.212
that if he doesn't come,

18:45.852 --> 18:47.842
I'll invite the Jiang family here.

18:47.962 --> 18:49.322
Yes.

18:54.162 --> 18:55.742
Everyone, have some tea.

18:55.762 --> 18:57.572
This time, my brother
narrowly escaped death,

18:57.572 --> 18:59.832
and you were worried about him.

18:59.852 --> 19:01.742
As everything is getting better,

19:01.762 --> 19:03.332
why don't we go on a trip together

19:03.332 --> 19:04.612
and enjoy ourselves for two days?

19:04.612 --> 19:05.972
- Sure!
- Sure!

19:12.202 --> 19:13.352
Where shall we go?

19:13.372 --> 19:15.212
- Let's go...
- Lingshui.

19:16.142 --> 19:18.872
Si and I were planning
to pay respects to our ancestors.

19:18.892 --> 19:20.382
After this disaster,

19:20.402 --> 19:22.172
we can also tell Yi we're safe.

19:22.202 --> 19:23.552
You're quite clever,

19:23.572 --> 19:25.032
tricking us

19:25.052 --> 19:26.732
to send you on your business.

19:27.292 --> 19:29.222
It's lively with so many people.

19:29.242 --> 19:30.232
Besides,

19:30.252 --> 19:32.832
the scenery along the way is beautiful.

19:32.852 --> 19:35.082
I guarantee you'll like it.

19:35.102 --> 19:37.742
In a few days, I'll have to go
to the Imperial Insignia Guard.

19:37.762 --> 19:39.002
We shouldn't delay.

19:39.002 --> 19:40.722
I'll go back and tell Father.

19:40.722 --> 19:42.272
We'll set out tomorrow.

19:42.292 --> 19:43.962
Zhan, before we leave,

19:43.962 --> 19:45.932
let's visit Mr. Zhen.

19:46.652 --> 19:49.142
This is your second withdrawal.

19:49.162 --> 19:50.522
Yes.

19:52.132 --> 19:53.892
The mastermind, Cui Mingyue,

19:53.922 --> 19:56.002
has been recognized as an accomplice.

19:56.092 --> 19:58.172
She's just been demoted one rank.

19:58.852 --> 20:00.762
What kind of punishment is that?

20:02.612 --> 20:05.732
Mr. Zhan, you've suffered a lot.

20:06.322 --> 20:08.792
Will you be content to let it go?

20:08.812 --> 20:11.132
Or have you chosen to make peace

20:11.652 --> 20:13.762
because of the rewards you received?

20:15.162 --> 20:17.422
Mr. Zhen, are you despising me?

20:17.442 --> 20:19.322
His Majesty's edict

20:19.722 --> 20:22.412
is both to appease and to test.

20:22.652 --> 20:24.362
If you refuse the rewards

20:24.362 --> 20:25.682
and insist on pursuing the case,

20:25.682 --> 20:26.942
Cui Mingyue

20:26.962 --> 20:29.142
will receive the punishment
she deserves.

20:29.162 --> 20:31.322
That's easy for you to say.

20:33.402 --> 20:34.742
If it were you,

20:34.762 --> 20:36.212
what would you do?

20:39.332 --> 20:40.972
If it were me,

20:48.442 --> 20:50.362
I would pursue it to the end,

20:50.652 --> 20:52.082
no matter the cost.

21:02.922 --> 21:04.282
Miss Si,

21:04.402 --> 21:05.762
Young Master Zhan,

21:06.762 --> 21:07.942
I'm not one to sit idly

21:07.962 --> 21:10.132
and discuss it without action.

21:10.292 --> 21:11.702
If you two are willing,

21:11.722 --> 21:12.962
I would risk my position

21:12.962 --> 21:14.352
and fight for you

21:14.372 --> 21:15.792
to the end.

21:15.812 --> 21:17.032
If His Majesty

21:17.052 --> 21:19.002
still insists on protecting her,

21:19.132 --> 21:21.932
I will speak out

21:22.242 --> 21:23.892
at the risk of my life.

21:28.092 --> 21:29.762
Thank you, Mr. Zhen,

21:29.892 --> 21:31.252
but

21:31.532 --> 21:32.892
there is no need.

21:33.092 --> 21:35.702
Miss Si, don't you trust me?

21:35.722 --> 21:36.982
I trust you,

21:37.002 --> 21:38.202
but my family

21:38.202 --> 21:39.562
cannot afford this.

21:40.052 --> 21:41.522
We all know

21:41.572 --> 21:42.982
you're a good official,

21:43.002 --> 21:44.762
so you should contribute
to the well-being

21:44.762 --> 21:46.182
of the people of Ling'an.

21:46.202 --> 21:47.532
You shouldn't take such a risk

21:47.532 --> 21:48.532
for the case

21:48.532 --> 21:50.522
of our family.

21:51.332 --> 21:52.692
Besides,

21:52.962 --> 21:54.892
you are honorable and fearless,

21:55.332 --> 21:56.802
while we

21:57.652 --> 21:59.172
are just common people.

21:59.402 --> 22:00.922
Our family

22:00.922 --> 22:02.092
isn't exactly satisfied

22:02.092 --> 22:03.832
with this outcome,

22:03.852 --> 22:07.252
but we know we should stop for now.

22:07.962 --> 22:10.172
Please don't trouble yourself, Mr. Zhen.

22:10.442 --> 22:11.802
Goodbye.

22:17.472 --> 22:20.072
(Court, Capital Security)

22:20.092 --> 22:21.452
Miss Si, wait.

22:23.242 --> 22:25.972
Is there something else, Mr. Zhen?

22:27.652 --> 22:29.252
I...

22:31.202 --> 22:32.662
It's nothing,

22:32.682 --> 22:34.562
I just wanted to talk with you

22:34.612 --> 22:36.002
for a moment.

22:39.292 --> 22:41.442
Zhan, please go ahead

22:41.442 --> 22:43.132
and wait for me.

22:44.052 --> 22:45.412
Sure.

23:05.162 --> 23:06.522
Miss Si,

23:06.962 --> 23:09.002
I still have feelings for...

23:09.002 --> 23:10.362
Mr. Zhen.

23:11.652 --> 23:14.362
Zhen, you really shouldn't

23:14.722 --> 23:18.182
waste more effort on me.

23:18.202 --> 23:19.512
Did I say something

23:19.532 --> 23:20.792
to upset you just now?

23:20.812 --> 23:21.742
No.

23:21.762 --> 23:23.512
You're upright.

23:23.532 --> 23:25.182
I truly admire

23:25.202 --> 23:26.802
what you said earlier.

23:27.052 --> 23:28.032
I knew

23:28.052 --> 23:29.932
you'd understand me.

23:30.242 --> 23:32.032
The Grand Princess is powerful.

23:32.052 --> 23:33.842
If it were anyone else,

23:34.162 --> 23:35.842
I wouldn't press it.

23:36.052 --> 23:37.332
But you are someone

23:37.332 --> 23:38.742
who doesn't fear rumors

23:38.762 --> 23:40.592
or the power of wealth.

23:40.612 --> 23:41.922
You can even stand up in court...

23:41.922 --> 23:43.282
Zhen,

23:43.892 --> 23:45.162
my brother has just experienced

23:45.162 --> 23:46.562
a great disaster

23:46.962 --> 23:48.312
and is only alive

23:48.332 --> 23:50.212
by the grace of Heaven.

23:51.002 --> 23:52.502
For the rest of our lives,

23:52.522 --> 23:54.142
I just wish for our family

23:54.162 --> 23:56.172
to stay safe and sound.

23:57.212 --> 23:59.972
Also, the Jiang Si you mentioned...

24:00.642 --> 24:02.892
The one who was once

24:02.892 --> 24:05.452
brave enough to stand up in court

24:06.652 --> 24:08.562
is not the complete Jiang Si.

24:08.762 --> 24:10.492
Most of the time,

24:10.762 --> 24:13.172
I'm afraid, I avoid things,

24:13.432 --> 24:14.832
and I also weigh the pros and cons.

24:14.852 --> 24:16.762
You don't need to belittle yourself.

24:17.092 --> 24:19.762
Great courage often appears
as hesitation.

24:20.132 --> 24:22.592
How many women in this world

24:22.612 --> 24:24.892
can possess the kind
of courage you have?

24:25.052 --> 24:27.072
I'm not belittling myself.

24:27.092 --> 24:28.512
Zhen,

24:28.532 --> 24:31.082
I'm not as good as you think.

24:32.002 --> 24:33.732
Heaven has its dark clouds;

24:33.762 --> 24:35.492
people have their darker sides.

24:37.052 --> 24:38.732
In court,

24:39.442 --> 24:41.362
I have told lies.

24:41.962 --> 24:43.602
Outside of court,

24:43.962 --> 24:46.082
I've used schemes

24:47.002 --> 24:48.692
to achieve my goals.

24:48.762 --> 24:50.492
But in your world,

24:50.512 --> 24:52.072
things are either black or white,

24:52.092 --> 24:55.002
so you and I

24:55.242 --> 24:57.072
are not suitable for each other.

25:07.652 --> 25:09.132
I don't see it that way.

25:10.692 --> 25:12.692
Dripping water wears away the stone.

25:12.722 --> 25:14.252
With sincere effort...

25:14.512 --> 25:16.902
But I'm not the stone
for your water to wear.

25:18.892 --> 25:21.042
Miss Si, are you refusing me

25:21.532 --> 25:23.452
because you've fallen

25:23.652 --> 25:25.012
for someone else?

25:25.052 --> 25:26.382
I refuse you

25:26.402 --> 25:27.482
simply because you and I

25:27.482 --> 25:28.972
are not a match.

25:29.132 --> 25:31.202
It has nothing to do with anyone else.

25:36.762 --> 25:38.172
I see.

25:40.372 --> 25:41.732
Goodbye.

25:44.482 --> 25:45.842
Miss Si.

25:48.852 --> 25:49.792
Has Yu Qi

25:49.812 --> 25:51.652
seen your dark side?

25:52.002 --> 25:53.842
Does he know everything about you?

25:58.242 --> 25:59.602
Yes.

26:25.592 --> 26:33.112
(Capital Security Office)

27:03.432 --> 27:10.952
(Capital Security Office)

27:27.052 --> 27:28.792
How is it? Does it look good?

27:28.812 --> 27:30.172
It's beautiful.

27:39.092 --> 27:41.132
Yu Qi, you're here.

27:43.442 --> 27:44.802
What's wrong?

27:45.102 --> 27:46.632
Look at the flowers I arranged for you.

27:46.632 --> 27:47.992
Do they look good?

27:50.652 --> 27:52.102
That night, you saved me.

27:52.122 --> 27:54.042
I have to thank you.

27:54.962 --> 27:56.982
If I had known what you did,

27:57.002 --> 27:58.562
I'd never have saved you.

27:59.372 --> 28:00.732
Yu Qi,

28:01.372 --> 28:02.702
don't force me

28:02.702 --> 28:04.192
to resort to the worst.

28:04.892 --> 28:06.252
Goodbye.

28:07.602 --> 28:09.702
Yu Qi, I know who you are.

28:14.002 --> 28:15.612
What are you trying to say?

28:18.162 --> 28:21.092
You've secretly returned to Ling'an
without being summoned.

28:21.922 --> 28:23.452
Does His Majesty know?

28:24.532 --> 28:27.972
Are you threatening me?

28:29.402 --> 28:31.002
You're a clever man.

28:31.332 --> 28:33.362
You should understand what I mean.

28:33.532 --> 28:34.892
I don't.

28:37.482 --> 28:39.252
Yu Qi, I like you.

28:39.962 --> 28:42.312
I don't care if you're an exiled Prince

28:42.332 --> 28:44.172
or some Commandant.

28:44.482 --> 28:46.252
If you go to Lingshui with me,

28:46.292 --> 28:47.652
I'll ensure you a wealthy future

28:47.652 --> 28:49.172
with a high position.

28:50.532 --> 28:52.532
A County Princess is promising a Prince

28:52.532 --> 28:53.922
a wealthy future

28:53.922 --> 28:55.482
with a high position?

28:55.482 --> 28:58.032
Seems like the Grand Princess

28:58.052 --> 29:00.762
is really powerful in Ling'an.

29:00.962 --> 29:02.842
Why mention my mother?

29:03.162 --> 29:04.682
Do you truly think

29:04.682 --> 29:05.812
that power is enough

29:05.812 --> 29:08.282
to make everything go your way?

29:09.332 --> 29:11.202
Why did Cao Xingyu,
Marquis Changxing's heir,

29:11.202 --> 29:13.972
end up in prison?

29:14.092 --> 29:16.352
Why did Ji Chongyi, Duke An's heir,

29:16.372 --> 29:17.682
get banned from being an official?

29:17.682 --> 29:22.082
And you, the once Commandery Princess,

29:22.292 --> 29:24.512
have been demoted to a County Princess

29:24.532 --> 29:26.632
and had to leave Ling'an in disgrace.

29:26.652 --> 29:28.792
I don't think you should worry

29:28.812 --> 29:31.282
about my future.

29:33.002 --> 29:34.872
Your Grace, listen to my advice.

29:34.892 --> 29:37.652
Don't make any more mistakes

29:37.922 --> 29:40.042
and ruin your future.

29:43.332 --> 29:45.462
Is it because of Jiang Si?

29:45.482 --> 29:46.632
Let me tell you.

29:46.652 --> 29:49.002
If anyone dares to covet

29:49.132 --> 29:50.832
what I like,

29:50.852 --> 29:52.662
I will gouge their eyes out

29:52.682 --> 29:54.452
and cut off their hands.

30:12.242 --> 30:14.132
You're welcome to have a try.

30:14.762 --> 30:16.442
If you dare

30:16.442 --> 30:18.252
harm Jiang Si,

30:18.532 --> 30:19.922
let's see if the Commandant

30:19.922 --> 30:21.902
you spoke of

30:21.922 --> 30:22.922
will take your life,

30:22.922 --> 30:25.172
County Princess.

30:33.242 --> 30:36.042
No man has ever dared to reject me.

30:39.682 --> 30:41.042
Yu Qi.

30:41.652 --> 30:43.252
(One day, )

30:44.682 --> 30:46.002
(I will make you willingly come)

30:46.002 --> 30:47.602
(to propose to me.)

30:55.442 --> 30:56.602
Aman.

30:56.622 --> 30:57.482
Miss Chuchu.

30:57.482 --> 30:58.762
I was just about to visit you.

30:58.762 --> 30:59.592
Why are you here?

30:59.612 --> 31:00.762
Young Master Zhan hasn't had

31:00.762 --> 31:01.922
much of an appetite lately,

31:01.922 --> 31:03.462
so Miss Si asked me to buy some pastries

31:03.462 --> 31:04.902
for him to eat on the road.

31:04.922 --> 31:06.572
The incident with the County Princess

31:06.572 --> 31:08.522
must be still affecting him.

31:09.092 --> 31:10.402
Miss Chuchu, you might not know.

31:10.402 --> 31:11.762
I saw the County Princess

31:11.762 --> 31:13.422
getting on a carriage
to head to Lingshui

31:13.442 --> 31:15.462
with a lot of money and valuables.

31:15.482 --> 31:17.562
It doesn't seem like she's exiled

31:17.582 --> 31:19.582
but more like she's going on holidays.

31:21.332 --> 31:22.902
Aman, you go back first

31:22.922 --> 31:23.852
and tell Jiang Zhan

31:23.852 --> 31:25.212
I'll be there later.

31:27.482 --> 31:28.842
Chu...

31:30.762 --> 31:33.332
Should I not have told her?

31:33.352 --> 31:39.152
(Jiang)

31:40.242 --> 31:41.922
Chuchu is supposed to be here by now.

31:41.922 --> 31:43.512
Why isn't she here yet?

31:43.722 --> 31:45.212
Young Master Zhan.

31:46.402 --> 31:47.292
Young Master Zhan.

31:47.292 --> 31:49.052
Aman, did you see Miss Chuchu

31:49.052 --> 31:50.932
on your way back?

31:52.132 --> 31:54.312
She said she had something to do

31:54.332 --> 31:55.692
and would come later.

31:55.892 --> 31:57.252
Something to do?

31:58.442 --> 31:59.312
Young Master Zhan,

31:59.332 --> 32:01.422
I'm busy. I'll leave now.

32:01.442 --> 32:02.352
Wait.

32:02.372 --> 32:03.012
Aman,

32:03.022 --> 32:04.512
didn't she tell you where she's going?

32:04.512 --> 32:09.592
(Lingshui County)

32:21.832 --> 32:29.352
(Lingshui County)

32:38.912 --> 32:42.512
(Lingshui County)

32:50.472 --> 32:51.992
(Lingshui County)

32:55.372 --> 32:56.732
This way.

33:13.592 --> 33:15.712
(Lingshui County)

33:19.242 --> 33:20.382
What's wrong?

33:20.402 --> 33:22.732
Why stop? Let's go.

33:24.752 --> 33:29.312
(Lingshui County)

33:42.792 --> 33:47.392
(Lingshui County)

33:57.632 --> 33:59.752
(Lingshui County)

34:09.932 --> 34:11.882
Why haven't we reached the hostel?

34:12.772 --> 34:14.012
Your Grace, please forgive me.

34:14.012 --> 34:15.182
I also find it strange.

34:15.202 --> 34:16.882
We should've reached the hostel by now.

34:16.882 --> 34:19.012
Perhaps we took a longer detour.

34:19.412 --> 34:20.452
Useless thing.

34:20.452 --> 34:21.812
It's so hot.

34:22.652 --> 34:24.532
Your Grace, it seems we've

34:24.532 --> 34:26.212
passed this place already.

34:26.362 --> 34:27.932
Could it be that we're trapped here?

34:27.932 --> 34:29.552
What nonsense are you talking about?

34:29.572 --> 34:30.882
Looks like someone will be

34:30.882 --> 34:32.652
sleeping in the woods tonight.

34:34.932 --> 34:36.292
Who is it?

34:37.452 --> 34:38.812
Let's go.

34:45.092 --> 34:46.222
- Don't run.
- Stop.

34:46.242 --> 34:49.442
- Don't run.
- Stop.

34:49.612 --> 34:52.362
- Stop.
- Don't run.

34:52.362 --> 34:53.512
Stop!

34:53.532 --> 34:54.892
Stop right there.

35:02.672 --> 35:03.552
Chuchu.

35:03.572 --> 35:05.182
(Jiang)
Where did you go?

35:05.202 --> 35:06.592
I just wandered a little.

35:06.612 --> 35:08.512
Aman, have you finished packing?

35:08.532 --> 35:10.052
You wandered...

35:10.882 --> 35:12.652
Did you get hurt?

35:12.932 --> 35:14.412
No, it was just a scratch

35:14.412 --> 35:15.682
from the carriage on the road.

35:15.682 --> 35:17.042
Miss Chuchu.

35:18.132 --> 35:19.092
I've packed everything.

35:19.092 --> 35:19.792
Where's Miss Si?

35:19.812 --> 35:21.342
At Haitang Chamber. Let's go find her.

35:21.342 --> 35:22.102
Alright, let's go.

35:22.122 --> 35:23.242
Come on, Young Master Zhan.

35:23.242 --> 35:24.602
Let's go.

35:28.322 --> 35:30.012
So mysterious?

35:31.362 --> 35:32.942
I'll get you some medicine.

35:36.362 --> 35:38.532
Chief, we found something
on Directorate of Astronomy.

35:38.532 --> 35:40.652
It was Astronomer Chu and Registrar Xiao

35:40.652 --> 35:42.432
who started to slander you as ill-fated.

35:42.452 --> 35:43.762
Where are they now?

35:43.762 --> 35:44.952
They're both in Lingshui.

35:44.972 --> 35:46.572
Lingshui.

35:47.102 --> 35:48.372
Let's return to the city first.

35:48.372 --> 35:49.612
We'll go to Lingshui tomorrow.

35:49.612 --> 35:50.662
No need to return.

35:50.682 --> 35:51.762
I've packed everything

35:51.762 --> 35:52.682
we need for the road.

35:52.682 --> 35:54.252
We can set off now.

35:57.162 --> 35:58.952
A fortune-teller back then

35:58.972 --> 36:00.512
once said I was an unlucky child.

36:00.532 --> 36:01.862
So, my father

36:01.882 --> 36:03.612
sent me far away.

36:03.802 --> 36:04.992
If the weak

36:05.012 --> 36:06.362
are unjustly blamed for everything

36:06.362 --> 36:08.322
by the world,

36:08.362 --> 36:09.412
and they neither inquire

36:09.412 --> 36:10.742
nor resist,

36:10.762 --> 36:11.842
doesn't that make them

36:11.842 --> 36:13.302
accomplices

36:13.322 --> 36:15.172
to these villains' lies?

36:15.572 --> 36:17.142
If I've been falsely accused,

36:17.162 --> 36:19.142
I'll make sure the accusers

36:19.162 --> 36:20.532
pay the price.

36:24.882 --> 36:26.182
Chief.

36:26.202 --> 36:27.562
Chief?

36:33.682 --> 36:34.932
Chief, were you just

36:34.932 --> 36:36.762
worried about Miss Si?

36:37.352 --> 36:38.322
I'm not sure

36:38.322 --> 36:40.052
if I should say this,

36:40.412 --> 36:41.762
but I really fear Miss Si

36:41.762 --> 36:43.732
has already been using you.

36:44.572 --> 36:45.912
Chief, I haven't finished.

36:45.932 --> 36:47.882
I haven't started my analysis.

36:47.932 --> 36:49.162
I think Miss Si can prophesy

36:49.162 --> 36:51.052
like the Saintess.

36:51.052 --> 36:52.412
Chief.

37:00.682 --> 37:01.952
Yu.

37:01.972 --> 37:04.052
- Qi.
- Where are you going?

37:05.162 --> 37:07.682
I'm an Imperial Insignia Guard now,

37:07.682 --> 37:09.722
so we're returning to Lingshui
before I start

37:09.722 --> 37:11.262
to pay respects to our ancestors

37:11.282 --> 37:12.822
and enjoy the scenery.

37:12.842 --> 37:14.202
I've never been to Lingshui,

37:14.202 --> 37:15.412
so I thought I'd join the fun.

37:15.412 --> 37:17.072
Your plan sounds good.

37:17.092 --> 37:18.262
Commandant Yu,

37:18.282 --> 37:20.032
why don't you come with us?

37:20.052 --> 37:21.842
Yeah, the more the merrier.

37:21.842 --> 37:22.782
Sure.

37:22.802 --> 37:24.342
My chief has official duties.

37:24.362 --> 37:25.722
Official duties?

37:25.802 --> 37:26.802
I thought you were here

37:26.802 --> 37:28.282
to send us off.

37:28.282 --> 37:29.952
That's not totally true.

37:29.972 --> 37:30.932
We were just...

37:30.932 --> 37:33.862
We were just wandering around nearby

37:33.882 --> 37:35.702
without a destination in mind.

37:35.722 --> 37:37.802
Why don't we join you

37:38.012 --> 37:38.972
for some sightseeing?

37:38.972 --> 37:40.342
That sounds great.

37:40.362 --> 37:41.262
Yu,

37:41.282 --> 37:42.692
they're riding too slowly.

37:42.702 --> 37:44.212
I was just thinking of finding someone

37:44.212 --> 37:45.012
to race horses with.

37:45.032 --> 37:46.632
You want to race horses with Qi?

37:46.632 --> 37:48.012
Catch up with me first.

37:48.032 --> 37:49.132
Without a starting signal?

37:49.132 --> 37:50.162
You two go ahead.

37:50.162 --> 37:51.202
I need to catch my breath.

37:51.202 --> 37:52.762
Alright, keep up.

38:08.932 --> 38:10.292
What's wrong?

38:10.612 --> 38:11.972
Are you missing home?

38:21.012 --> 38:22.372
It's nothing.

38:24.052 --> 38:25.532
I'm glad you're here.

39:01.682 --> 39:03.042
Miss Jiang,

39:03.082 --> 39:04.132
the scenery is beautiful.

39:04.132 --> 39:05.202
Why not take a walk?

39:05.202 --> 39:06.632
Thank you, Commandant Yu.

39:06.652 --> 39:07.512
It's fine.

39:07.532 --> 39:09.652
I'll just sit here and enjoy the view.

39:10.242 --> 39:11.742
This isn't a court.

39:11.762 --> 39:14.022
Don't call me Commandant.
It's too formal.

39:16.052 --> 39:17.592
Shall I call you

39:17.612 --> 39:18.742
Mr. Yu?

39:18.762 --> 39:20.122
Sure.

39:20.572 --> 39:21.932
Mr. Yu,

39:22.882 --> 39:25.142
thank you

39:25.162 --> 39:26.602
for helping my brother.

39:26.622 --> 39:28.632
Neighbors are better
than distant relatives.

39:28.652 --> 39:29.682
If there's anything

39:29.682 --> 39:31.142
you need help with in the future,

39:31.162 --> 39:31.932
just let me know.

39:31.952 --> 39:33.462
Is it really just a neighborly thing?

39:33.482 --> 39:35.302
There are at least seven
or eight households

39:35.302 --> 39:36.912
living in our neighborhood,

39:36.932 --> 39:38.052
but I've never seen Mr. Yu

39:38.052 --> 39:39.912
put so much effort into other people.

39:39.932 --> 39:41.632
Miss, it's because of you.

39:41.652 --> 39:43.152
You're being talkative.

39:47.612 --> 39:48.472
Mr. Yu,

39:48.492 --> 39:49.842
I had a nightmare and dreamed

39:49.842 --> 39:51.582
my brother would be in danger,

39:51.722 --> 39:52.992
but when I told others,

39:53.012 --> 39:55.132
they all thought I was overreacting.

39:55.242 --> 39:56.802
Only you

39:56.802 --> 39:58.322
believed me.

39:58.762 --> 40:01.132
You didn't need to lie to me after all.

40:01.842 --> 40:03.532
But it is quite amazing

40:03.652 --> 40:05.732
when dreams come true.

40:06.362 --> 40:08.072
Have you ever dreamed of anything else?

40:08.092 --> 40:10.052
Maybe you can foresee the future.

40:14.242 --> 40:15.782
Mr. Yu, you're just joking.

40:15.802 --> 40:16.952
How could an ordinary person

40:16.952 --> 40:18.442
have such an ability?

40:26.972 --> 40:28.182
Yu, Si,

40:28.202 --> 40:29.802
there's a beautiful stream ahead.

40:29.802 --> 40:31.512
Shall we go and rest there for a while?

40:31.532 --> 40:32.782
I caught it!

40:32.802 --> 40:34.662
Long Dan, you're amazing!

40:34.682 --> 40:36.052
Chief, I caught it!

40:36.052 --> 40:37.282
Hurry and put it here.

40:37.282 --> 40:38.882
- So impressive!
- What a big fish!

40:38.882 --> 40:40.362
Hurry! It's so slippery!

40:41.012 --> 40:42.842
Isn't it too small?

40:43.762 --> 40:45.512
Watch me catch a bigger one.

40:45.532 --> 40:46.892
Come on.

40:47.492 --> 40:49.312
Young Master Zhan, can you do it?

41:02.242 --> 41:04.282
Zhan, you go start the fire.

41:04.682 --> 41:06.442
I'll go start the fire instead.

41:23.492 --> 41:25.172
There's no firewood.

41:25.802 --> 41:27.212
I'll help you.

41:27.372 --> 41:29.512
I'll go find some dry firewood
over there.

41:29.532 --> 41:30.952
Alright.

41:30.972 --> 41:32.652
Don't cut yourself.

41:46.282 --> 41:48.202
Jiang Zhan, look! I caught one!

41:48.202 --> 41:49.612
So impressive!

41:52.012 --> 41:53.372
What's wrong?

41:57.652 --> 41:59.012
What happened to you?

42:04.802 --> 42:06.402
Wait for me.

42:08.242 --> 42:10.532
What's wrong? Did you sprain your ankle?

42:13.612 --> 42:14.972
I'll carry you.

42:15.612 --> 42:16.972
Can you get on?

42:17.092 --> 42:19.212
One, two, go.

42:21.722 --> 42:23.082
Let's go.

42:27.722 --> 42:30.052
Put me down.

42:31.012 --> 42:32.482
It's going to rain.

42:33.242 --> 42:35.112
I'll carry you to the woods ahead.

42:35.132 --> 42:36.492
Let's go.

42:40.282 --> 42:41.642
Slow down.

42:44.242 --> 42:45.602
Slowly.

42:49.912 --> 42:54.232
(The End of Episode 15)

42:54.682 --> 42:56.412
♪ From place to place ♪

42:56.412 --> 43:01.352
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:01.722 --> 43:04.102
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:04.102 --> 43:08.332
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:09.042 --> 43:11.442
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:11.462 --> 43:15.122
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:15.142 --> 43:18.562
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:18.712 --> 43:24.232
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:25.052 --> 43:28.732
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:28.732 --> 43:32.812
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:33.052 --> 43:34.792
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.812 --> 43:39.512
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:39.512 --> 43:43.082
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:43.102 --> 43:47.332
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:47.352 --> 43:49.132
♪ Time glows ♪

43:49.132 --> 43:53.672
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:53.692 --> 43:58.492
♪ And stars ♪

44:02.722 --> 44:05.252
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:05.272 --> 44:08.892
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.912 --> 44:12.342
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:12.362 --> 44:16.982
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.982 --> 44:20.672
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:20.692 --> 44:24.782
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.892 --> 44:26.712
♪ Time glows ♪

44:26.712 --> 44:31.262
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:31.282 --> 44:34.982
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:35.002 --> 44:39.162
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:39.342 --> 44:41.102
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:41.102 --> 44:45.622
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:45.622 --> 44:49.262
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:49.282 --> 44:54.952
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:56.642 --> 44:58.572
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:58.572 --> 45:06.072
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
